240
00:14:43.165 --> 00:14:44.390
The answer is b.

241
00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:47.853
The account is trusted for
unconstrained delegation,

242
00:14:47.853 --> 00:14:52.548
and Microsoft Learn's delegated
managed service account documentation

243
00:14:52.548 --> 00:14:56.165
says that stops working once
